816
01:26:31,649 --> 01:26:35,204
Birds high upon the trees

817
01:26:35,364 --> 01:26:39,878
Serenade the clouds with their melody

818
01:26:40,190 --> 01:26:45,098
Oh oh, see there beyond the hills,

819
01:26:45,245 --> 01:26:50,480
The bright colors of the rainbow

820
01:26:50,805 --> 01:26:54,379
Some magic from above

821
01:26:54,440 --> 01:26:56,680
Made this days for us

822
01:26:56,731 --> 01:27:00,176
Just to fall in love

823
01:27:00,495 --> 01:27:04,543
You hold me in your arms,

824
01:27:04,683 --> 01:27:09,695
