825
01:27:09,928 --> 01:27:13,602
And if your love is true,

826
01:27:13,653 --> 01:27:19,036
Everything will be just as wonderful

827
01:27:26,238 --> 01:27:29,708
Now, I belong to you

828
01:27:30,481 --> 01:27:35,614
From this day until forever,

829
01:27:35,984 --> 01:27:39,308
Just love me tenderly

830
01:27:39,460 --> 01:27:44,079
And I'll give to you every part of me

831
01:27:44,314 --> 01:27:49,448
Oh oh, don’t ever make me cry

832
01:27:49,502 --> 01:27:54,797
Through long lonely nights without love

833
01:27:54,963 --> 01:27:58,230
Be always true to me,

834
01:27:58,450 --> 01:28:03,643
Keep this day in your heart eternally

835
01:28:04,230 --> 01:28:08,221
You hold me in your arms,

836
01:28:08,561 --> 01:28:13,465
And say once again you love me,

837
01:28:13,686 --> 01:28:17,083
And if your love is true,

838
01:28:17,181 --> 01:28:22,530
Everything will be just as wonderful

839
01:28:36,361 --> 01:28:37,768
